{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2021-09-24 07:30:00', 'title': 'AXON ANNOUNCES MICROSOFT, SKYDIO AND VERIZON AS TOP SPONSORS FOR 2021 ACCELERATE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ., SEPT. 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED MICROSOFT AS THE TITLE SPONSOR OF AXON ACCELERATE, THE PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE.'}